# Play test of Ringstone Hill (CIPlay ringstone_hill, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the jetty and its crate, the
# keeper's cabin and box, up to the ring of stones, into the bear's cave under the hill and its chest, the treasure.
# Points as in its recipe.
island Ringstone Hill
offset 0 0
expect animals Bear 1
expect animals Goat 2
expect animals Turtle 2
wait 3
kill Bear
kill Screecher
# Along the jetty to its head, the crate
walk -43 2 to -50 2 to -55 2 h=1.5 below=4
open Crate on the jetty
# The keeper's cabin
walk -24.75 -6 to -24.75 -4 to -24.75 -1 h=4.1 below=5
expect stand -24.75 -1 h=4.1 below=5
open Keeper's box
# The hilltop and its stones
at 0 2
expect height 14
# The bear's cave: in from the south beach to its chest
walk 8 -47 to 8 -40 to 8 -34 to 9.5 -31 h=2.1 below=3
expect stand 8 -34 h=2.1 below=3
open Chest in the cave
# The keeper's sea chest by the wreck
at -52 21.5
open The keeper's sea chest
dig
